	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0301_infomationw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いらっしゃいませ！▼
エレベータを　おつかいに　なるなら
とびら　もしくは▽
よこの　スイッチを　おしてください</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いらっしゃいませ！▼
エレベータを　お使いになるなら
扉　もしくは▽
隣の　コンパネを　押してくださいませ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T09:30:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>INFOMATIONW
受付</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0301_businessman_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いやあ……　いつも　ポケモンの
わざ「さわぐ」で　おこされて▽
ちょいと　ボロボロ　なんです▼
でも　おこしてくれる　かのじょのため
きょうも　はりきって　がんばりますよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:32:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いやあ……　いつも　ポケモンの
技「さわぐ」で　起こされて▽
ちょいと　ボロボロ　なんです▼
でも　起こしてくれる　彼女のため
今日も　はりきって　がんばりますよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:33:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:32:37" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BUSINESSMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0301_trainerw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみの　もってる　ソレって
ポケモンずかん　でしょ！▼
へえ！　すっごいじゃん！
ポケモンを　あつめてるんだ！▼
わかった！
あたしも　てつだうね▼
ねーねー　さいしょに　えらんだ
ポケモンは　なーにー？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:33:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:33:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみの　持ってる　ソレって
ポケモン図鑑　でしょ！▼
へえ！　すっごいじゃん！
ポケモンを　集めてるんだ！▼
わかった！
あたしも　手伝うね▼
ねーねー　最初に　選んだ
ポケモンは　なーにー？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:33:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:33:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手前
・選択肢表示
※swanで新規作成
　c02r0501にいたNPC</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:34:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:33:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0301_trainerw_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ツタージャね！
じゃあ　これを　あげる！▼
ポケモンに　もたせると　くさタイプの
わざの　いりょくが　あがるんだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:34:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:34:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ツタージャね！
じゃあ　これを　あげる！▼
ポケモンに　持たせると　くさタイプの
技の　威力が　あがるんだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:34:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:34:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ツタージャ(草）選択
・アイテム入手処理
　No239「きせきのタネ」</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:34:50" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:34:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0301_trainerw_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ミジュマルね！
じゃあ　これを　あげる！▼
ポケモンに　もたせると　みずタイプの
わざの　いりょくが　あがるんだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:34:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
