	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0301_trainerw_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポカブね！
じゃあ　これを　あげる！▼
ポケモンに　もたせると　ほのおタイプの
わざの　いりょくが　あがるんだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:34:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:34:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポカブね！
じゃあ　これを　あげる！▼
ポケモンに　持たせると　ほのおタイプの
技の　威力が　あがるんだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
